{"id":"b286b5d2520ff936","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-semantic-substitution.md","title":"项与公式的语义代入引理","display":"lem-semantic-substitution — 项与公式的语义代入引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-semantic-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-semantic-substitution"],"display":"lem-semantic-substitution — 项与公式的语义代入引理","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.1.1–2.1.2, print27–28/PDF39–40; local proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-semantic-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-semantic-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-semantic-substitution — 项与公式的语义代入引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"102b16872a6480ee\" href=\"?note=102b16872a6480ee\" title=\"72-lem-semantic-locality\">72-lem-semantic-locality</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.1.1–2.1.2, print27–28/PDF39–40; local proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in D^V\">\\(s\\in D^V\\)</span> 与求值取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(u,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubTrm}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubTrm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[t/x]\">\\(A[t/x]\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c073b947b255638\" href=\"?note=3c073b947b255638\" title=\"72-df-calculus-syntax\">72-df-calculus-syntax</a>；公式等式只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\)</span> 成立时断言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\mathrm{SubTrm}(u,t,x)⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}=⟦ u⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}]}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\mathrm{SubTrm}(u,t,x)⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}=⟦ u⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}]}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A[t/x])=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}]}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A[t/x])=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}]}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项结论按子项归纳；变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的分支恰是更新坐标，其他变量与常元保持。公式的原子与布尔分支随即成立。量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"QyB\">\\(QyB\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y=x\">\\(y=x\\)</span>，绑定遮蔽该坐标；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不自由出现，用局部性引理。余下情形自由代入条件给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\)</span>，所以更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 的值，两个不同坐标的更新可交换，逐个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span> 应用归纳假设。这里没有把部分自由代入当作全定义替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-calculus-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-semantic-locality","status":"resolved","id":"102b16872a6480ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-locality]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle$、$s\\in D^V$ 与求值取 [[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]；$u,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$x\\in V$，$A\\in X_\\Sigma$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-calculus-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"3c073b947b255638","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SubTrm}$、$A[t/x]$ 和 $\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}$ 取 [[72-df-calculus-syntax]]；公式等式只在 $\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)$ 成立时断言。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=\\langle D,I_C,I_F,I_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in D^V","display":false},{"tex":"u,t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in X_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubTrm}","display":false},{"tex":"A[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)","display":false},{"tex":"⟦\\mathrm{SubTrm}(u,t,x)⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}=⟦ u⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}]}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FreeFor}_{72}(t,x,A)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s}(A[t/x])=\\operatorname{val}_{\\mathfrak M,s[x\\mapsto⟦ t⟧_{\\mathfrak M,s}]}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"QyB","display":false},{"tex":"y=x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false}],"bytes":1967,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-465","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-substitution|lem-semantic-substitution — 项与公式的语义代入引理]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-443","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]]"},{"id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：无量词片段按子公式的语法成员关系检测，显式区分对象量词节点与元语言量化。求值的自由变量局部性与代入性质已在 [[72-lem-semantic-locality]]、[[72-lem-semantic-substitution]] 给出独立证明；这些为后续性质导航。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-semantic-substitution|lem-semantic-substitution — 项与公式的语义代入引理]]"},{"id":"dd527eaf83c7e032","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"edf9ec90faf33353","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2e4e495c5c3c9961","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-404","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-semantic-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["5c014dab66d624c8","3c073b947b255638","102b16872a6480ee"]}